{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.303, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:51.069Z", "t_ms": 7300, "delta": " A-MEM, memory retrieval for a new interaction operates through embedding similarity and interconnected"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.542, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:51.307Z", "t_ms": 7539, "delta": " memory links:\n\n* **Query Encoding:** Given a query text $q$ from the current interaction, the system computes its dense vector representation"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.716, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:51.482Z", "t_ms": 7713, "delta": " $e_{q} = f_{\\text{enc}}(q)$ using the same text encoder employed for memory notes ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.951, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:51.716Z", "t_ms": 7948, "delta": "C2].\n* **Similarity Computation:** The system calculates cosine similarity scores between the query embedding $e_q$ and the embeddings"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.15, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:51.915Z", "t_ms": 8146, "delta": " $e_i$ of all existing memory notes $m_i$ in the memory storage $\\mathcal{M}$ ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.353, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:52.118Z", "t_ms": 8350, "delta": "C2].\n* **Top-$k$ Note Retrieval:** The system ranks the scores and retrieves the $k$ most relevant memory"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.6, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:52.366Z", "t_ms": 8597, "delta": " notes ($\\mathcal{M}_{\\text{retrieved}} = \\{m_{i} \\mid \\text{rank}(s_{q,i"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.762, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:52.527Z", "t_ms": 8758, "delta": "}) \\leq k, m_{i} \\in \\mathcal{M}\\}$) [C2].\n* **"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.005, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:52.770Z", "t_ms": 9001, "delta": "Linked Memory Access:** Drawing on Zettelkasten principles, memory notes in A-MEM are interconnected into \"boxes\" via"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.233, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:52.998Z", "t_ms": 9230, "delta": " dynamic link generation [C1, C3]. When a relevant memory note is retrieved from the database, similar memories linked"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.419, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:53.184Z", "t_ms": 9415, "delta": " to it within the same box are also automatically accessed [C3].\n* **Prompt Construction:** The retrieved memories are"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.576, "data": {"request_id": "ff5ec4f71b70", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:00:53.342Z", "t_ms": 9573, "delta": " used to construct a contextually rich prompt, providing relevant historical context to inform the agent's reasoning and response for the interaction"}}
